      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 29,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "Therefore the LORD’s wrath was on Judah and Jerusalem, and he has delivered them to be tossed back and forth, to be an astonishment and a hissing, as you see with your eyes.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 유다와 예루살렘을 진노하시고 내어버리사 두려움과 놀람과 비웃음거리가 되게 하신 것을 너희가 목도하는바라",
      "source_text_hash": "bb8fda6cbe8e06f06bf8b1d4a438f954b821c95760d7bcd5d6eb25f1c53cd142",
      "translation_text_hash": "95cf4efa1107c17772f208648aed5e3dea4686277a5e3daa199a2437764b4ff6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 유다와 예루살렘을 진노하시고 내어버리사 두려움과 놀람과 비웃음거리가 되게 하신 것을 너희가 목도하는바라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "95cf4efa1107c17772f208648aed5e3dea4686277a5e3daa199a2437764b4ff6"
      ]
