      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 29,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "So they killed the bulls, and the priests received the blood and sprinkled it on the altar. They killed the rams and sprinkled the blood on the altar. They also killed the lambs and sprinkled the blood on the altar.",
      "ko": "이에 수소를 잡으매 제사장이 그 피를 받아 단에 뿌리고 또 수양을 잡으매 그 피를 단에 뿌리고 또 어린 양을 잡으매 그 피를 단에 뿌리고",
      "source_text_hash": "f93cc53e4ba20b6293eb812040691b22a005726af1fcebf52167e63502bd91ea",
      "translation_text_hash": "f7a1261b05a12fb49d4694577ce30e3cb190e1066994891d862fcc97d4154caa",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
