      "en": "They brought near the male goats for the sin offering before the king and the assembly; and they laid their hands on them.",
      "ko": "이에 속죄 제물로 드릴 수염소를 왕과 회중의 앞으로 끌어 오매 저희가 그 위에 안수하고",
      "source_text_hash": "368e18c87ebfdbe3c291511d71a9e180d2e538f75786b43dd6c46af298b74e8c",
      "translation_text_hash": "0c50d8e69c33e1b62a66fe53bd35eb6766a1f91a4578714b4b3cb469790279bd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
