      "en": "When they had finished offering, the king and all who were present with him bowed themselves and worshiped.",
      "ko": "제사 드리기를 마치매 왕과 그 함께 있는 자가 다 엎드려 경배하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "3df2cda26f9ceaa58d1ffb0da73bf38edb8bf1f70da0b7a291d40e59d7342bb5",
      "translation_text_hash": "5a47e1f47ba8cfd26ad2616733d9ed0afc0e37f0ddb6db8d4c1fe3691f9164d5",
