      "en": "The consecrated things were six hundred head of cattle and three thousand sheep.",
      "ko": "또 구별하여 드린 소가 육백이요 양이 삼천이라",
      "source_text_hash": "dfd344f9e9b86e675adf964ce8708a6483334d189057cf9d72970dc05967fdfb",
