      "en": "Also the burnt offerings were in abundance, with the fat of the peace offerings and with the drink offerings for every burnt offering. So the service of the LORD’s house was set in order.",
      "ko": "번제와 화목제의 기름과 각 번제에 속한 전제가 많더라 이와 같이 여호와의 전에서 섬기는 일이 순서대로 갖추어지니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2cc494faf09dfdf756c97c0a2c150157a0b8b406298354ad204bddd909e57d34",
      "translation_text_hash": "7a87ff6fc2e684ca875276989a1ad6e18a3ec455f9ac0820f2512820b2d7a29f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
