      "en": "Hezekiah and all the people rejoiced because of that which God had prepared for the people; for the thing was done suddenly.",
      "ko": "이 일이 갑자기 되었을찌라도 하나님이 백성을 위하여 예비하셨음을 인하여 히스기야가 백성으로 더불어 기뻐하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "899901acf26f64e866d98931955c43e405ee33069076c714aece28e28cfbfea1",
